   "officialDescription": "Nestled by the Floranpino Sea, the Valley is a scenic vacation area with high terrain around the edges and lower in the middle. The southern Beach Villa are surrounded by a bay, creating a secure and comfortable environment for the gang leader to securely place their wealth. Atop the low hills in the middle of the valley sits Noan Courtyard, used for gatherings, and a secluded Small Factory lies at the base of the mountains to the north, casting a shadow over the entire Valley, awaiting your exploration.",
