   "officialDescription": "The TV Station, true to its name, was the main broadcaster for most of native Kamona television. During the North-South Conflict, it was seized by the Northerners, but the Sumek Committee later intervened, bringing an end to the war. The station was eventually taken over by the White Wolves, who are believed to have installed the gas distribution system in the central area. Under Kayla's leadership, Blackgold Universal launched a siege of the TV Station, creating an opportunity for other groups to enter in search of the valuable remnants left behind.",
